  <reporting-org ref="GB-CHC-285776" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upper Nile State Recovery, Reintegration and Sustainable Livelihoods Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a 3 years project that will be implemented by the Catholic Development Office, Kosti Pastoral Region and will be working in Maban and Renk Counties, Upper Nile State.  The project will provide technical support to 3,900 direct beneficiaries (500 HHS farmers with agricultural seeds and tools, and 150 hhs small scale traders with non-farm activities). This will provide farmers with improved agriculture techniques, increase output per cultivable land, and strengthen community, SSRRC and Couty Commissioner Office capacities on DRR. The project will be implemented in close collaboration and coordination with State Ministry of Agriculture in Malakal, Upper Nile University, and County authorities.  CAFOD will employ an agriculturist accompanier to support the partner in the implementation of this project, and will be working very closely with field staff; project officer, extension workers and the community.</narrative>
  </description>
